Pass the `excludeColumns` option with an array of column names or dataFields to hide:

```typescript
this.myCommon.showExportDialog({
  gridInstance: this.myGrid.instance,
  reportTitle: 'My Report',
  fileName: 'My_Report',
  excludeColumns: ['Recalculate', 'Actions'],
});
```

These columns will be hidden before export and restored after.
